          "label": "agents in parallel"
        },
        {
          "value": "PDF",
          "label": "and JSON export"
        }
      ],
      "highlights": [
        "Embeddings computed locally: no code is ever sent to a third-party service",
        "Chroma index keyed by user, repository and SHA: an unchanged repo reuses its index",
        "GitHub OAuth through a single-use code rather than JWTs in the URL, token Fernet-encrypted"
      ],
